{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43250","headline":"三让月成魄 · 刘?","name":"三让月成魄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲礼依天象，周旋逐月成。\n教人三让美，爲客一宵生。\n初进轮犹暗，终辞影渐明。\n幸陪宾主位，取舍任亏盈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘?","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}